OL,3,GNEWSAPortsmouth migrant boat witness
OL,4,Aurges compassion
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who witnessed the RNLI help a
OL,7,Fgroup of migrants after crossing the
OL,8,FEnglish Channel in a dinghy has said
OL,9,Fpeople need to have more compassion.
OL,11,FDemonstrators blocked roads in an
OL,12,Fattempt to stop coaches carrying the
OL,13,F120 migrants from leaving Portsmouth on
OL,14,FSunday night, following a separate
OL,15,Fprotest at the Port of Dover the day
OL,16,Fbefore.
OL,18,FIn a video posted on social media,
OL,19,Feyewitness Troy said: "I saw very
OL,20,Fclosely with my own eyes some very
OL,21,Fscared women and children that were
OL,22,Fgetting off that boat."
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
